{"duration_api_ms":61425,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"641307dd-f9f7-4879-855c-45760f5049bc","total_cost_usd":0.1592696,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19636,"cache_read_input_tokens":90218,"output_tokens":9212,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1639},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":19636},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":575,"cache_read_input_tokens":29950,"cache_creation_input_tokens":156,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":156,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":9212,"cacheReadInputTokens":90218,"cacheCreationInputTokens":19636,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1592696,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1639,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":4,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I built the validator as the `csvcheck/` package in the project root, with tests in `tests/` and a short `README.md`. All 16 tests pass. I haven't run it by hand on a real schema and CSV beyond those tests.\n\nRun it with `python -m csvcheck SCHEMA.json DATA.csv`, and run the tests with `python -m unittest discover tests`.\n\nThe spec left some cases open, so I made these choices (the README lists them too):\n\n- **Short and long rows:** a row with fewer fields than the header counts the missing ones as empty. Extra fields are ignored.\n- **Blank lines:** a blank line is a record with all empty values, so it counts in the row numbers and fails any required column.\n- **Strict formats:** `int`, `float` and `date` accept only plain ASCII forms. `1_0`, Arabic-Indic digits, `nan`, `inf`, `1e999` and `20240101` are all rejected. A value with leading or trailing spaces is not trimmed, so it fails too.\n- **Several errors per value:** a value that breaks more than one rule gets one error line for each. If the type is wrong, the `min`/`max` check is skipped.\n- **Bad schemas exit 2:** besides the shape checks the spec asks for, the validator rejects `min` or `max` on a column that isn't `int` or `float`, duplicate column names, and an invalid regex.\n- **`allowed` values:** non-string entries are turned into text first, so `1` in the list matches the CSV value `1`.\n- **Encoding:** files are read as UTF-8, and a leading BOM is accepted. Invalid UTF-8 exits 2.\n\nThe 16 tests take about 10 seconds to run, because each one launches the program as a separate process.","ttft_ms":14331,"type":"result","duration_ms":220601,"uuid":"5203bfca-0419-4129-9d22-d9efe023679e","ttft_stream_ms":792,"time_to_request_ms":169,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":31,"system_prompt":44,"resume_other":2,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":24,"input_hooks":1,"tool_pool_refresh":5,"init_message":2,"engine_pickup":1,"autocompact":2,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":22,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":14,"request_build":14},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":105,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":97,"time_to_request_major_faults":78,"first_content_frame_ms":792,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
